@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Local Mistral V1
+
+Upstream: https://github.com/didilili/shopkeeper-agent
+Revision: 8045fa4d61608f58df551fda6cd1a70529bb5b67
+License: MIT, copyright didilili; original LICENSE and README are retained.
+
+This local extension connects Mistral chat and embedding APIs, corrects AOV metadata,
+adds read-only SQL validation and a SELECT-only warehouse account, and exposes actual
+SQL in the existing React frontend. It remains a single-user local teaching-data demo.
+
+See ../../docs/NL2SQL_V1.md in the parent workspace for the current PRD, acceptance
+evidence, limitations, and startup commands. Full extension source is also preserved
+as ../../integrations/shopkeeper/local.patch against the pinned upstream commit.
+
+Current URLs: UI http://127.0.0.1:38088 and API http://127.0.0.1:38080/docs.
+Database ports: MySQL 33306, Elasticsearch 39200, Qdrant 36333, all loopback only.
+Use docker/compose.local.yaml, not the upstream docker/docker-compose.yaml.
+
+The .env file must contain LLM_API_KEY; keep it private and out of Git.
+The default local database passwords are demo credentials; this compose file must
+not be exposed to the public internet or used as a production deployment.
